BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:casemiro-6@manutd-wc2026
DTSTAMP:20260610T225254Z
DTSTART:20260613T220000Z
DTEND:20260614T000000Z
SUMMARY:Casemiro (Brazil) vs Morocco — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:NRG Stadium\, Houston\, TX
DESCRIPTION:Defensive midfielder · United's midfield anchor and enforcer\n\
 n• Holding midfielder who shields the back line\; joined United from Real 
 Madrid in 2022.\n• Five-time Champions League winner — one of the most dec
 orated midfielders of his era.\n• Surprisingly prolific in 2025–26\, scori
 ng nine league goals from deep.\n• Hugely experienced Brazil international
  and on-field leader.\n• Style: positional discipline\, ferocious tackling
 \, late runs — but picks up plenty of cards.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cunha-6@manutd-wc2026
DTSTAMP:20260610T225254Z
DTSTART:20260613T220000Z
DTEND:20260614T000000Z
SUMMARY:Matheus Cunha (Brazil) vs Morocco — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:NRG Stadium\, Houston\, TX
DESCRIPTION:Forward / attacking midfielder · Club-record-fee signing\, crea
 tive front-man\n\n• Versatile forward who can play as a 9\, a 10 or off th
 e left\; a £62.5m signing from Wolves in 2025.\n• One of United's top scor
 ers in 2025–26 (10 league goals) in his debut season.\n• An Olympic gold m
 edallist with Brazil at the Tokyo 2020 Games.\n• Brings flair\, fight and 
 fan-favourite energy.\n• Style: creative\, press-resistant and combative i
 n tight spaces.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mazraoui-6@manutd-wc2026
DTSTAMP:20260610T225254Z
DTSTART:20260613T220000Z
DTEND:20260614T000000Z
SUMMARY:Noussair Mazraoui (Morocco) vs Brazil — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:NRG Stadium\, Houston\, TX
DESCRIPTION:Full-back · Versatile defender across the back line\n\n• Versat
 ile right-back who can also play left-back or in midfield\; signed from Ba
 yern in 2024.\n• A key figure in Morocco's historic run to the 2022 World 
 Cup semi-finals.\n• An Ajax academy product with Champions League pedigree
 .\n• Reliable two-way full-back for club and country.\n• Style: tidy in po
 ssession\, tactically intelligent and defensively solid.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bayindir-8@manutd-wc2026
DTSTAMP:20260610T225254Z
DTSTART:20260614T040000Z
DTEND:20260614T060000Z
SUMMARY:Altay Bayındır (Turkey) vs Australia — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:Lumen Field\, Seattle\, WA
DESCRIPTION:Goalkeeper · Squad goalkeeper\n\n• Goalkeeper who pushed for Un
 ited's number one shirt before Senne Lammens' arrival.\n• Signed from Fene
 rbahçe in 2023.\n• An experienced Turkey international keeper.\n• Style: a
  strong shot-stopper who is comfortable with the ball at his feet.\n• Like
 ly a backup option for Turkey at the tournament.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:zirkzee-10@manutd-wc2026
DTSTAMP:20260610T225254Z
DTSTART:20260614T200000Z
DTEND:20260614T220000Z
SUMMARY:Joshua Zirkzee (Netherlands) vs Japan — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:Arrowhead Stadium\, Kansas City\, MO
DESCRIPTION:Forward · Rotation centre-forward / link striker\n\n• Technical
  centre-forward and squad option\, signed from Bologna in 2024.\n• Develop
 ed at Bayern Munich before breaking out in Serie A.\n• Chipped in importan
 t goals from the bench in 2025–26.\n• Capped by the Netherlands\, though h
 is World Cup squad place is not guaranteed.\n• Style: hold-up play\, a sof
 t first touch and clever combination football.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:deligt-10@manutd-wc2026
DTSTAMP:20260610T225254Z
DTSTART:20260614T200000Z
DTEND:20260614T220000Z
SUMMARY:Matthijs de Ligt (Netherlands) vs Japan — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:Arrowhead Stadium\, Kansas City\, MO
DESCRIPTION:Centre-back · Senior central defender and organiser\n\n• Comman
 ding centre-back who joined United from Bayern Munich in 2024.\n• Former A
 jax captain who reached a Champions League semi-final as a teenager and wo
 n the 2018 Golden Boy award.\n• Scored a dramatic stoppage-time equaliser 
 at Tottenham in November 2025.\n• A long-serving Netherlands international
  and natural leader.\n• Style: aggressive front-foot defending\, strong in
  the air\, composed in possession.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
