SUMMARY:Amad Diallo (Ivory Coast) vs Ecuador — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:Gillette Stadium\, Foxborough\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Winger / wing-back · Direct\, creative wide attacker\n\n• Right
  winger or attacking wing-back who joined from Atalanta in 2021.\n• Scored
  a dramatic late FA Cup winner in the Manchester derby — an instant fan fa
 vourite.\n• An Ivory Coast international full of flair and unpredictabilit
 y.\n• Productive in 2025–26 with goals against Nottingham Forest and Bourn
 emouth.\n• Style: low centre of gravity\, fearless dribbling and creativit
 y in tight areas.
END:VEVENT
