DESCRIPTION:Goalkeeper · First-choice goalkeeper\n\n• Goalkeeper who became
  United's first choice during 2025–26 after a move from Royal Antwerp.\n• 
 A young Belgian shot-stopper who settled quickly at Old Trafford.\n• Tall 
 and commanding in his box.\n• Style: sharp reflexes and modern\, ball-play
 ing distribution.\n• An emerging option in the Belgium goalkeeping pool.
END:VEVENT
