 ntre-back signed from Lille in 2024 as one of Europe's brightest prospects
 .\n• Overcame an early foot injury to establish himself in the side in 202
 5–26.\n• A France youth standout now pushing into the senior set-up.\n• St
 yle: pace\, sharp recovery defending\, composure and aerial ability — a ve
 ry high ceiling.
