 eft-footed centre-back nicknamed 'The Butcher' (El Carnicero).\n• Joined U
 nited from Ajax in 2022.\n• A 2022 World Cup winner with Argentina.\n• Ret
 urned from a long knee injury during the 2025–26 season.\n• Style: ferocio
 us in duels and excellent on the ball despite a smaller frame for a defend
 er.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
