DTSTART:20260617T170000Z
DTEND:20260617T190000Z
SUMMARY:Bruno Fernandes (Portugal) vs Congo DR — 2026 World Cup
LOCATION:Mercedes-Benz Stadium\, Atlanta\, GA
DESCRIPTION:Attacking midfielder · Manchester United captain and creative t
 alisman\n\n• United's captain since 2023 and the team's heartbeat\; joined
  from Sporting CP in January 2020.\n• Broke the Premier League single-seas
 on assist record (21) in 2025–26 and won both the FWA and Premier League P
 layer of the Season.\n• Elite penalty taker and set-piece deliverer with a
  habit of scoring spectacular long-range goals.\n• A Portugal mainstay wit
 h 80+ caps\, long playing alongside Cristiano Ronaldo.\n• Style: relentles
 s energy\, vision and visible leadership — when he plays well\, United usu
 ally do.
END:VEVENT
