 n\n• Versatile full-back comfortable on either flank\; United's regular ri
 ght-back.\n• A Porto academy product who joined United in 2018.\n• Tireles
 s up and down the touchline with much-improved defending.\n• An establishe
 d Portugal international valued for stamina and tactical flexibility.\n• S
 tyle: attacking\, high-energy\, dependable two-way output.
